# CAD (docs/44, cad/README.md)
#   cad/renders/ - 54 MB of Blender previews from cad/render_all_3d.sh:
#   regenerable output, never committed. The CAD files that ARE tracked are
#   deliberate: cad/params.yaml (the only dimension source), cad/params.scad
#   (generated), cad/fit_coupon.scad, cad/stl/*.stl.
cad/renders/

# Guard against code that creates "~/" literally (unexpanded user home)
~
